 ],
 "note": "p100 = PZ LQFP-100 from sn74abth32543 p.1 (read from the drawing: 1-25 left side top to bottom, 26-50 bottom left to right, 51-75 right side bottom to top, 76-100 top right to left). Each 18-bit section is a '543: function table p.3 (A to B shown; B to A same with CEBA/LEBA/OEBA): CEAB H -> B Z; OEAB H -> B Z; CEAB L, LEAB H, OEAB L -> B holds B0 (latched); CEAB L, LEAB L, OEAB L -> B = A (transparent). Description p.2: CEAB must be low to enter data from A or to output data to B; LEAB low = transparent, low-to-high stores. 5962-9557801NXD is the SMD of this PZ part (packaging table p.9). Bus hold not modeled.",
